{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe heat was dreadful today. I sat facing backwards in the Kassel coach, a position that suits a man of my age, allowing me to observe the world receding while I watch my own face age in the glass. My companion, a Göttingen student, clutched the rear seat number one with the tenacity of a man defending a state’s constitution, refusing to yield an inch to the other passengers. It is a small, petty form of freedom, but I admire the stubbornness.\n\nWe followed the Lahn river, the water dark and sluggish under the sun. The food at the inn was thin broth and stale bread, but the wine was passable. I have sent for a change of shirts; the travel dust is becoming a nuisance. I do not know if you received my last letter regarding the printing proofs, but I suspect the typesetter is as slow as the river.\n\nI am tired but content. Do not worry.\n\nYour affectionate\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795219310,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":211,"prompt_tokens":1116,"total_tokens":1327,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-PPDyT7TfTP1O25V3G7zz2Sz04k9U1a3b","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1116,"prompt_ms":1050.859,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9416299283154121,"prompt_per_second":1061.9883352571562,"predicted_n":211,"predicted_ms":4939.609,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.52194761904762,"predicted_per_second":42.51348639133178}}